                /><span>2020&apos;s</span></label
              >
            </fieldset>
            <p class="pf-error" data-error-for="music_styles"></p>
          </section>

          <section
            class="pf-step"
            data-step="8"
            data-section="Your music"
            hidden
          >
            <p class="pf-section-kicker">Music preferences</p>
            <h2>Is there any music you would NOT like to hear?</h2>
            <p class="pf-help">
              Let’s protect your musical vision! Check any categories below that
              make you cringe, and we’ll make sure they stay far away from the
              speakers.
            </p>
            <fieldset
              class="pf-chip-grid pf-no-go-grid"
              aria-label="Music categories to avoid"
            >
              <label class="pf-chip">
                <input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="songs_to_skip_categories[]"
                  value="overplayed_wedding_classics"
                />
                <span>
                  <span aria-hidden="true">🔁</span> Overplayed Wedding Classics
                  <small
                    >The usual suspects you’ve heard at every single reception</small
                  >
                </span>
              </label>
              <label class="pf-chip">
                <input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="songs_to_skip_categories[]"
                  value="traditional_line_dances"
                />
                <span>
                  <span aria-hidden="true">🕺</span> Traditional Line Dances
                  <small>Cha Cha Slide, Cupid Shuffle...</small>
                </span>
              </label>
              <label class="pf-chip">
                <input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="songs_to_skip_categories[]"
                  value="cheesy_gimmick_songs"
                />
                <span>
                  <span aria-hidden="true">🎭</span> Cheesy / Gimmick Songs
                  <small>Anything that feels a bit too “carnival DJ”</small>
                </span>
              </label>
              <label class="pf-chip">
                <input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="songs_to_skip_categories[]"
                  value="grandmas_golden_oldies"
                />
                <span>
                  <span aria-hidden="true">🪩</span> Grandma’s Golden Oldies
                  <small
                    >Outdated tracks that slow the party down to a crawl</small
                  >
                </span>
              </label>
              <label class="pf-chip">
                <input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="songs_to_skip_categories[]"
                  value="explicit_unedited_tracks"
                />
                <span>
                  <span aria-hidden="true">🔇</span> Explicit / Unedited Tracks
                  <small
                    >Keep the lyrics clean for mixed-generation crowds</small
                  >
                </span>
              </label>
              <label class="pf-chip">
                <input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="songs_to_skip_write_in_enabled"
                  value="yes"
                  data-other-toggle="songs_to_skip_write_in"
                />
                <span>✍️ Add specific song/artist exclusions</span>
              </label>
            </fieldset>
            <div
              id="songs_to_skip_write_in_wrap"
              class="pf-inline-field"
              hidden
            >
              <label class="pf-field-label" for="songs_to_skip">
                Specific song/artist exclusions (optional)
              </label>
              <input
                id="songs_to_skip"
                name="songs_to_skip"
                type="text"
                class="pf-input"
                maxlength="500"
                placeholder="Song titles or artists"
              />
            </div>
            <p class="pf-error" data-error-for="songs_to_skip"></p>
          </section>

          <section
            class="pf-step"
            data-step="9"
            data-section="Your music"
            hidden
          >
            <p class="pf-section-kicker">Music planning</p>
            <h2 id="music-involvement-heading">
              How would you like to handle your music planning?
            </h2>
            <p class="pf-help">
              Select all that apply. Every host approaches music differently —
              some prefer full creative control, while others love leaving it in
              our expert hands. There is no right or wrong way to collaborate!
              Choose the options below that best match your comfort level.
            </p>
            <fieldset
              class="pf-choice-group pf-checkbox-group"
              aria-labelledby="music-involvement-heading"
            >
              <label class="pf-choice pf-card-choice">
                <input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="music_involvement[]"
                  value="trust_expert"
                />
                <span class="pf-card-title">Trust the Expert: Hands-Off</span>
                <small>
                  We trust your expertise! We’d love for you to read the crowd,
                  take the wheel, and surprise us with great music throughout
                  the event.
                </small>
              </label>
              <label class="pf-choice pf-card-choice">
                <input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="music_involvement[]"
                  value="vibe_demographic_guide"
                />
                <span class="pf-card-title">
                  Vibe &amp; Demographic Guide: High-Level Direction
                </span>
                <small>
                  We’d like to share our favorite genres, overall vibe, and
                  guest demographics, then let you craft the flow around those
                  guidelines.
                </small>
              </label>
              <label class="pf-choice pf-card-choice">
                <input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="music_involvement[]"
                  value="curated_playlists"
                />
                <span class="pf-card-title">
                  Curated Playlists: Specific Songs &amp; Favorites
                </span>
                <small>
                  We have specific playlists or must-play/do-not-play lists we’d
                  like to provide to ensure our personal favorites are included.
                </small>
              </label>
              <label class="pf-choice pf-card-choice">
                <input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="music_involvement[]"
                  value="structured_timeline_flow"
                />
                <span class="pf-card-title">
                  Structured Timeline &amp; Flow: Detailed Vision
                </span>
                <small>
                  We have a specific vision for how we want the energy and music
                  to unfold across different parts of the event (e.g., cocktail
                  hour vs. peak dance floor).
                </small>
              </label>
            </fieldset>
            <p class="pf-error" data-error-for="music_involvement"></p>
          </section>

          <section
            class="pf-step"
            data-step="10"
            data-section="Your music"
            hidden
          >
            <p class="pf-section-kicker">Planning</p>
            <h2 id="planning-style-heading">
              How would you describe your event planning vibe?
            </h2>
            <p class="pf-help">
              Select one. No judgment here — whether you’re delegating
              everything or organizing spreadsheets by color code, knowing your
              style helps us communicate with you in the best way possible!
            </p>
            <fieldset
              class="pf-choice-group pf-radio-group"
              aria-labelledby="planning-style-heading"
            >
              <label class="pf-choice pf-card-choice">
                <input type="radio" name="planning_style" value="super_chill" />
                <span class="pf-card-title">
                  Super Chill &amp; Go-With-the-Flow
                </span>
                <small>
                  I’m relaxed, trust the process completely, and just want
                  everyone to have a good time. Tell me where to stand and what
                  to do!
                </small>
              </label>
              <label class="pf-choice pf-card-choice">
                <input
                  type="radio"
                  name="planning_style"
                  value="guided_organized"
                />
                <span class="pf-card-title">Guided &amp; Organized</span>
                <small>
                  I have a good sense of what I want and like staying on top of
                  details, but I’m totally open to expert advice and ideas.
                </small>
              </label>
              <label class="pf-choice pf-card-choice">
                <input
                  type="radio"
                  name="planning_style"
                  value="detail_oriented_vision_driven"
                />
                <span class="pf-card-title">
                  Detail-Oriented &amp; Vision-Driven
                </span>
                <small>
                  I have a very specific vision for the day. I love clear
                  timelines, prompt communication, and getting every little
                  detail just right.
                </small>
              </label>
              <label class="pf-choice pf-card-choice">
                <input
                  type="radio"
                  name="planning_style"
                  value="full_on_event_director"
                />
                <span class="pf-card-title">Full-On Event Director</span>
                <small>
                  I know exactly what I want, down to the minute. I’m hands-on,
                  highly detailed, and executing a flawless event is my top
                  priority!
                </small>
              </label>
            </fieldset>
            <p class="pf-error" data-error-for="planning_style"></p>
          </section>

          <section
            class="pf-step"
            data-step="11"
            data-section="The extras"
            hidden
          >
            <p class="pf-section-kicker">Lighting</p>
            <h2>Which lighting services interest you?</h2>
            <p class="pf-help">Select all that apply.</p>

            <fieldset class="pf-choice-group pf-checkbox-group">
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="lighting[]"
                  value="uplighting"
                /><span>Uplighting</span></label
              >
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="lighting[]"
                  value="basic_dance_floor_lighting"
                /><span>Basic dance floor lighting</span></label
              >
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="lighting[]"
                  value="advanced_dance_floor_buildout"
                /><span>Advanced club style lighting build-out</span></label
              >
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="lighting[]"
                  value="whole_room_lighting"
                /><span>Whole-room lighting and décor</span></label
              >
              <label class="pf-choice pf-choice--exclusive"
                ><input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="lighting[]"
                  value="not_interested"
                  data-exclusive="lighting"
                /><span>I&apos;m not interested in lighting services</span
                ></label
              >
            </fieldset>
            <p class="pf-error" data-error-for="lighting"></p>
          </section>

          <section
            class="pf-step"
            data-step="12"
            data-section="The extras"
            hidden
          >
            <p class="pf-section-kicker">Add-ons</p>
            <h2>Interested in any additional services?</h2>
            <p class="pf-help">
              In partnership with longtime collaborators and trusted vendors.
            </p>
            <fieldset class="pf-choice-group pf-checkbox-group">
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="addons[]"
                  value="live_saxophone"
                /><span>Live saxophone</span></label
              >
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="addons[]"
                  value="live_guitar"
                /><span>Live guitar</span></label
              >
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="addons[]"
                  value="live_violin"
                /><span>Live violin</span></label
              >
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="addons[]"
                  value="portrait_lounge"
                /><span>Portrait lounge</span></label
              >
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="addons[]"
                  value="lighting_design"
                /><span>Lighting design</span></label
              >
              <label class="pf-choice pf-choice--exclusive"
                ><input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="addons[]"
                  value="none"
                  data-exclusive="addons"
                /><span>None of these</span></label
              >
            </fieldset>
            <p class="pf-error" data-error-for="addons"></p>
          </section>

          <section
            class="pf-step"
            data-step="13"
            data-section="The extras"
            hidden
          >
            <p class="pf-section-kicker">Budget</p>
            <h2>
              Please tell us your ballpark budget range for DJ, music, and
              related services.
            </h2>
            <p class="pf-help">
              This helps us more closely match services to your budget.
            </p>

            <div class="pf-budget-wrap">
              <div class="pf-budget-value" id="budget_value">
                $2,500 - $10,000
              </div>
              <div class="pf-budget-track-wrap">
                <div
                  id="budget-slider"
                  class="pf-budget-slider"
                  aria-label="Budget range"
                >
                  <div id="budget-rail" class="pf-budget-rail"></div>
                  <div
                    id="budget-low-handle"
                    class="pf-budget-handle pf-budget-handle--low"
                    tabindex="0"
                    role="slider"
                    aria-label="Minimum budget"
                    aria-valuemin="2500"
                    aria-valuemax="10000"
                    aria-valuenow="2500"
                  >
                  </div>
                  <div
                    id="budget-high-handle"
                    class="pf-budget-handle pf-budget-handle--high"
                    tabindex="0"
                    role="slider"
                    aria-label="Maximum budget"
                    aria-valuemin="2500"
                    aria-valuemax="10000"
                    aria-valuenow="10000"
                  >
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <input type="hidden" name="budget_min" value="2500" />
              <input type="hidden" name="budget_max" value="10000" />
              <input type="hidden" name="budget_touched" value="false" />
            </div>
            <p class="pf-error" data-error-for="budget"></p>
          </section>

          <section
            class="pf-step"
            data-step="14"
            data-section="The extras"
            hidden
          >
            <p class="pf-section-kicker">Spending mindset</p>
            <h2>How would you describe your approach to spending?</h2>
            <p class="pf-help">
              Why we ask about your approach: Every couple’s event priorities
              and spending style are unique. Whether you’re working with a firm
              target or planning an all-out celebration, there is no wrong
              answer! Knowing how you view your budget helps us suggest options,
              prioritize features, and tailor a proposal that feels entirely
              comfortable for you.
            </p>
            <fieldset class="pf-choice-group pf-radio-group">
              <label class="pf-choice pf-card-choice">
                <input
                  type="radio"
                  name="spending_mindset"
                  value="firm_target"
                />
                <span class="pf-card-title">Firm Target</span>
                <small>
                  Staying strictly within our selected price range is a primary
                  priority for us.
                </small>
              </label>
              <label class="pf-choice pf-card-choice">
                <input
                  type="radio"
                  name="spending_mindset"
                  value="balanced_approach"
                />
                <span class="pf-card-title">Balanced Approach</span>
                <small>
                  We’d prefer to stay near our target, but can adjust slightly
                  for priority items that make a big difference.
                </small>
              </label>
              <label class="pf-choice pf-card-choice">
                <input
                  type="radio"
                  name="spending_mindset"
                  value="vision_driven"
                />
                <span class="pf-card-title">Vision-Driven</span>
                <small>
                  Our budget is flexible, and we are willing to invest more for
                  high-impact details and seamless quality.
                </small>
              </label>
              <label class="pf-choice pf-card-choice">
                <input
                  type="radio"
                  name="spending_mindset"
                  value="unrestricted"
                />
                <span class="pf-card-title">Unrestricted</span>
                <small>
                  Money is not a constraining factor; our focus is on curating a
                  fully custom, top-tier experience.
                </small>
              </label>
            </fieldset>
            <p class="pf-error" data-error-for="spending_mindset"></p>
          </section>

          <section
            class="pf-step"
            data-step="15"
            data-section="Where you're at"
            hidden
          >
            <p class="pf-section-kicker">Decision stage</p>
            <h2>Where are you in your decision?</h2>
            <fieldset class="pf-choice-group pf-radio-group">
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input
                  type="radio"
                  name="decision_stage"
                  value="browsing"
                /><span>I&apos;m just getting started and browsing</span></label
              >
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input
                  type="radio"
                  name="decision_stage"
                  value="comparing_vendors"
                /><span>I&apos;m comparing different vendors</span></label
              >
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input
                  type="radio"
                  name="decision_stage"
                  value="few_questions"
                /><span
                  >I&apos;m very interested and just have a few questions for
                  you</span
                ></label
              >
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input
                  type="radio"
                  name="decision_stage"
                  value="only_dj"
                /><span>You&apos;re the only DJ for us</span></label
              >
            </fieldset>
            <p class="pf-error" data-error-for="decision_stage"></p>
          </section>

          <section
            class="pf-step"
            data-step="16"
            data-section="Where you're at"
            hidden
          >
            <p class="pf-section-kicker">Your wedding priorities</p>
            <h2>Tell us what is most important to you on your wedding day.</h2>
            <p class="pf-help">
              The more detail you share, the better we can understand what
              matters to you and how to help make your day feel right.
            </p>
            <textarea
              id="wedding_priorities"
              name="wedding_priorities"
              class="pf-input pf-textarea"
              rows="5"
              maxlength="1000"></textarea>
            <p class="pf-error" data-error-for="wedding_priorities"></p>
          </section>

          <section
            class="pf-step"
            data-step="17"
            data-section="Where you're at"
            hidden
          >
            <p class="pf-section-kicker">How to reach you</p>
            <h2>What&apos;s the best way to reach you?</h2>
            <fieldset
              class="pf-choice-group pf-checkbox-group"
              id="contact_method_group"
            >
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="contact_method[]"
                  value="text"
                /><span>Text</span></label
              >
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="contact_method[]"
                  value="email"
                /><span>Email</span></label
              >
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input
                  type="checkbox"
                  name="contact_method[]"
                  value="phone_call"
                /><span>Phone call</span></label
              >
            </fieldset>

            <div class="pf-inline-field pf-inline-field--spaced">
              <label class="pf-field-label">Best time to reach you</label>
              <div class="pf-chip-row">
                <label class="pf-chip"
                  ><input
                    type="checkbox"
                    name="best_time[]"
                    value="mornings"
                  /><span>Mornings</span></label
                >
                <label class="pf-chip"
                  ><input
                    type="checkbox"
                    name="best_time[]"
                    value="afternoons"
                  /><span>Afternoons</span></label
                >
                <label class="pf-chip"
                  ><input
                    type="checkbox"
                    name="best_time[]"
                    value="evenings"
                  /><span>Evenings</span></label
                >
                <label class="pf-chip"
                  ><input
                    type="checkbox"
                    name="best_time[]"
                    value="no_preference"
                    data-exclusive="best_time"
                  /><span>No preference</span></label
                >
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="pf-error" data-error-for="contact_method"></p>
            <p class="pf-error" data-error-for="best_time"></p>
          </section>

          <section
            class="pf-step"
            data-step="18"
            data-section="Where you're at"
            hidden
          >
            <p class="pf-section-kicker">Anything else</p>
            <h2>What are your most burning questions for DJ Misha?</h2>
            <p class="pf-help">What would make this the right fit for you?</p>
            <textarea
              id="anything_else"
              name="anything_else"
              class="pf-input pf-textarea"
              rows="6"
              maxlength="2000"></textarea>
            <p class="pf-error" data-error-for="anything_else"></p>
          </section>

          <section
            class="pf-step"
            data-step="19"
            data-section="Meet DJ Misha"
            hidden
          >
            <p class="pf-section-kicker">Let&apos;s talk it through.</p>
            <h2>Meet & Greet with DJ Misha</h2>
            <p class="pf-help">
              DJ Misha personally meets with couples. Pick the weekday that
              works best for a video call at <strong>2:00 PM Pacific</strong>.
            </p>
            <p class="pf-help pf-help--muted">
              We&apos;ll confirm the exact date by email.
            </p>

            <fieldset class="pf-choice-group pf-radio-group">
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input type="radio" name="meeting_day" value="monday" /><span
                  >Monday</span
                ></label
              >
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input type="radio" name="meeting_day" value="tuesday" /><span
                  >Tuesday</span
                ></label
              >
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input
                  type="radio"
                  name="meeting_day"
                  value="wednesday"
                /><span>Wednesday</span></label
              >
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input type="radio" name="meeting_day" value="thursday" /><span
                  >Thursday</span
                ></label
              >
              <label class="pf-choice"
                ><input type="radio" name="meeting_day" value="friday" /><span
                  >Friday</span
                ></label
              >
              <label class="pf-choice pf-choice--exclusive"
                ><input
                  type="radio"
                  name="meeting_day"
                  value="skip_for_now"
                /><span>Skip for now</span></label
              >
            </fieldset>

            <p class="pf-error" data-error-for="meeting_day"></p>
          </section>
        </div>

        <div class="pf-actions">
          <button type="button" id="pf-back" class="pf-back-btn" hidden>
            Back
          </button>
          <button type="button" id="pf-next" class="pf-primary-btn"
            >Continue</button
          >
          <button type="submit" id="pf-submit" class="pf-primary-btn" hidden>
            Send to DJ Misha
          </button>
        </div>
      </form>

      <div id="pf-success" class="pf-success" hidden>
        <div class="pf-card pf-card--narrow">
          <p class="pf-eyebrow">Done</p>
          <h1 id="pf-success-name">You&apos;re all set!</h1>
          <p id="pf-success-message">DJ Misha will be in touch.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <script src="/wedding-planning/pf.js" defer></script>
  </body>
</html>
